# Advanced Entity AI & External Asset Support

Instead of internal 3D modeling, we will focus on deep AI customization and compatibility with external tools like Blockbench.

## Recommendations for External 3D Work
For 3D models and textures, I highly recommend:
- **[Blockbench](https://www.blockbench.net/)**: Use this to create your skins and models. You can export textures as `.png` files and use them in this Mod Maker.
- **[Planet Minecraft](https://www.planetminecraft.com/)**: Excellent for finding community-made textures.

